#: f630d569a31c425daa145f5068fcd927
msgid "fa-py-libraries installed"
msgstr "已安装 fa-py-libraries"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:35
#: e56aea38894048e29675039a4244a37c
msgid ""
"Network between the headset and the ROS 2 machine (Wi-Fi, or **USB 网络共享**"
" on Pico Enterprise)"
msgstr "头显与 ROS 2 主机之间的网络（Wi-Fi，或 Pico 企业版上的 **USB 网络共享**）"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:36
#: 7b194b08cbeb4290b84791f1ac09ddb3
msgid ""
"**`enable_vr: true`** in the robot description’s "
"`config/ocs2/target_manager.yaml` (most robots default off)"
msgstr ""
"在机器人描述的 `config/ocs2/target_manager.yaml` 中设置 **`enable_vr: "
"true`**（多数机型默认关闭）"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:38
#: 7a72abaac39641809d3b43fd1bf75ddc
msgid ""
"Before the controller will consume VR targets, set `enable_vr: true` in "
"that YAML. Related fields on the same file: `vr_update_rate` (used when "
"VR is on) and `vr_follow_frame` (full-body follow frame; see "
"[Troubleshooting](#troubleshooting))."
msgstr ""
"控制器要消费 VR 目标之前，先在该 YAML 里把 `enable_vr: true` "
"打开。同一文件里相关字段：`vr_update_rate`（启用 VR 后生效）和 `vr_follow_frame`（全身跟随坐标系；见 "
"[故障排除](#troubleshooting)）。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:40
#: 05d9cef813e44f76bae44a1454926646
msgid "Overview"
msgstr "概述"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:42
#: 0825d96af24b496eae9493f0c54ba627
msgid ""
"With controllers, VR teleoperation publishes end-effector pose targets "
"from controller tracking. The MPC controller then generates joint "
"trajectories to follow these targets. Optical wrist and bare-hand "
"gestures are [Hand tracking](#vr-hand-tracking)."
msgstr ""
"走手柄时，VR 遥操作按手柄追踪发布末端位姿目标。MPC 控制器再生成关节轨迹去跟这些目标。光学腕和空手手势见 [手部追踪](#vr-hand-"
"tracking)。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:44
#: 8e806b77665d4e03b46f6ccf61e46f82
msgid ""
"On a real arm, use [force control and "
"compliance](../4-controllers/13-force_control.md) when the arm should "
"comply with contact. MIT-mode force control covers Panthera HT and ARX. "
"Vendor joint impedance and payload identification cover Tianji and Rokae."
msgstr ""
"真机上，手臂要在接触时柔顺，就用 [力控与柔顺](../4-controllers/13-force_control.md)。Panthera "
"HT 和方舟无限走 MIT 力控。天玑和珞石走厂商关节阻抗，负载辨识也在这条路径上。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:46
#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:72
#: 3613e9148c3940cc9ff30ef20f6d8715 763dc55ceb074cc1abf1887edd0c1bea
msgid "Setup"
msgstr "设置"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:48
#: ea8f011dcc324d65a4f869d0ff16d7ca
msgid "1. Install fa-py-libraries"
msgstr "1. 安装 fa-py-libraries"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:50
#: c78e2c7859f54b2e8381bc74a2fe7633
msgid ""
"cd ~/\n"
"git clone https://github.com/fiveages-sim/fa-py-libraries.git\n"
"cd fa-py-libraries\n"
"./init.sh all"
msgstr ""
"cd ~/\n"
"git clone https://github.com/fiveages-sim/fa-py-libraries.git\n"
"cd fa-py-libraries\n"
"./init.sh all"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:57
#: 63e1e45c4d4746918dfe5b4166984350
msgid ""
"HTTPS is the public clone. SSH (`git clone git@github.com:fiveages-sim"
"/fa-py-libraries.git`) is optional if you already have keys."
msgstr ""
"公开克隆用 HTTPS。若本机已有密钥，SSH（`git clone git@github.com:fiveages-sim/fa-py-"
"libraries.git`）为可选项。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:59
#: 9548907526c34c6bb89620e236e3654d
msgid ""
"What `./init.sh all` does: submodules + Python 3.12 env + "
"`ros2_robot_interface` / `ros2-viser` / `vr_pose_publisher` / "
"`xr_hand_retarget`."
msgstr ""
"`./init.sh all` 会做：子模块 + Python 3.12 环境 + `ros2_robot_interface` / "
"`ros2-viser` / `vr_pose_publisher` / `xr_hand_retarget`。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:61
#: 2ae739f30612407aa7e28dfe45e16a97
