#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:122
#: 37cfb1dc3d064aeeae4528cd1ea3fe27
msgid "Hand tracking (手势)"
msgstr "手部追踪（手势）"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:124
#: 3f7a1dfd69c94f5ab6f7c38785bc8c57
msgid ""
"`./run.sh vr` and `./run.sh vr-xrt` follow the controllers. This path "
"uses the optical wrists and the bare hands."
msgstr "`./run.sh vr` 和 `./run.sh vr-xrt` 跟的是手柄。这条路径用光学腕和空手。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:126
#: 42cb00cdd7354ea9ac9a51a5563fe929
msgid ""
"PC Service is already running (`./run.sh vr-xrt-service`). From fa-py-"
"libraries:"
msgstr "PC Service 已经在跑（`./run.sh vr-xrt-service`）。在 fa-py-libraries 里："

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:128
#: 4ac0ca5d7fba4f698593cdeef8a1e2a0
msgid "./run.sh vr-xrt wrist"
msgstr "./run.sh vr-xrt wrist"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:132
#: 08fd6f99353d4fb2a76dcc466b9cb4c2
msgid ""
"`wrist` sends optical-wrist 6DoF to the arms and the bare-hand gesture "
"(空手手势) to the dexterous hands. The hand is `FA_HAND`, or `hands.type` in "
"`configs/local.yaml`: `xhand1`, `wuji`, `o6`, `l6`, `o7`. `FA_HAND` "
"overrides `local.yaml`. `FA_HAND=none` or `--no-hands` keeps the wrist "
"and does not start the hands."
msgstr ""
"`wrist` 把光学腕六自由度发给手臂，把空手手势发给灵巧手。手型用 `FA_HAND`，或 `configs/local.yaml` 里的 "
"`hands.type`：`xhand1`、`wuji`、`o6`、`l6`、`o7`。`FA_HAND` 覆盖 "
"`local.yaml`。`FA_HAND=none` 或 `--no-hands` 只留光学腕，不启动灵巧手。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:134
#: cf220d5ce7494d5fa81532373b98a5b8
msgid ""
"FA_HAND=wuji ./run.sh vr-xrt wrist\n"
"FA_HAND=none ./run.sh vr-xrt wrist\n"
"./run.sh vr-xrt wrist --no-hands"
msgstr ""
"FA_HAND=wuji ./run.sh vr-xrt wrist\n"
"FA_HAND=none ./run.sh vr-xrt wrist\n"
"./run.sh vr-xrt wrist --no-hands"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:140
#: 93820b092ce347d595e9120f0c1091a4
msgid ""
"`./run.sh vr-hand` asks which hand, then starts this same wrist path. A "
"choice other than `none` is written to `configs/local.yaml`."
msgstr ""
"`./run.sh vr-hand` 先问手型，再启动同一条光学腕路径。除 `none` 以外的选择会写入 "
"`configs/local.yaml`。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:142
#: 872d0ea0652743bf9d9ddac575183fcc
msgid ""
"One PC Service takes one SDK client. While `vr-xrt` is running, leave "
"`xr_hand_retarget` stopped."
msgstr "一个 PC Service 只接一个 SDK 客户端。`vr-xrt` 在跑时，不要再开 `xr_hand_retarget`。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:144
#: 6b4c15092e73433b9c40118105ec0cfa
msgid ""
"Hand on/off is the XRoboToolkit floating settings panel, not the RViz "
"teleop HUD. In the clip (Pico Enterprise passthrough, XRoboToolkit "
"1.1.2), Network Status is already **WORKING**, shared network is on, and "
"Enterprise tracking is checked. Under Tracking, Head stays on; turn "
"**Hand** on and **Controller** off. The physical controllers can stay on "
"the desk. Close the panel with the top-right **X** before teleop, so "
"later rays stay on the passthrough view. That close is the clip above."
msgstr ""
"手部追踪的开关在 XRoboToolkit 浮动设置面板上，不是 RViz 遥操作 HUD。这段录像（Pico "
"企业版透视，XRoboToolkit 1.1.2）里，网络状态已经是 **WORKING**，共享网络已开，企业追踪已勾选。Tracking "
"下面，Head 保持开；把 **Hand** 打开，**Controller** 关掉。实体手柄可以留在桌上。遥操作前用右上角 **X** "
"关掉面板，之后的射线才留在透视画面上。关掉面板的操作见上面那段录像。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:146
#: 5681ce28b3cc4217a8c9318bae493845
msgid ""
"<video controls preload=\"metadata\" width=\"100%\">\n"
"  <source src=\"../../_static/videos/vr-gesture-hand-tracking.mp4\" "
"type=\"video/mp4\">\n"
"</video>"
msgstr ""
"<video controls preload=\"metadata\" width=\"100%\">\n"
"  <source src=\"../../_static/videos/vr-gesture-hand-tracking.mp4\" "
"type=\"video/mp4\">\n"
"</video>"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:152
#: 44ee67116ac74b2c9d2137e7031f589e
msgid ""
"After the panel closes, the operator uses bare hands. The wheeled dual-"
"arm in the “VR 遥操作” view follows the gestures."
msgstr "面板关掉之后，操作者用空手。“VR 遥操作”画面里的轮式双臂跟着这些手势走。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:154
#: 36e1e926d0474ed9b35f1aa707356599
msgid ""
"The foot pedal still publishes events on `teleop/controller_state` (FSM, "
"UPDATE / STORAGE, mirror). With no pedal, `./run.sh vr-ocs2` publishes "
"`/fsm_command` `3` (OCS2)."
msgstr ""
"脚踏板仍把事件发在 `teleop/controller_state`（FSM、UPDATE / "
"STORAGE、镜像）。没有脚踏板时，`./run.sh vr-ocs2` 发布 `/fsm_command` `3`（OCS2）。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:156
#: 780b7768db0143f7a3dc969b8cbf36c2
msgid ""
"Wrist and headset poses stay on the `/teleop/*` set in [VR published "
"topics](../../3-concepts/4-fsm_and_topics.md#vr-published-topics). The "
"dexterous-hand joint command is `q_des` ([xr_hand_retarget "
"README](https://github.com/fiveages-"
"sim/xr_hand_retarget/blob/main/README.md))."
msgstr ""
"腕部和头显位姿仍在 [VR 发布话题](../../3-concepts/4-fsm_and_topics.md#vr-published-"
"topics) 的 `/teleop/*` 里。灵巧手关节命令是 `q_des`（[xr_hand_retarget "
"README](https://github.com/fiveages-"
"sim/xr_hand_retarget/blob/main/README.md)）。"

