#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:325
#: 7fb29621e6404ef08e531f9d51e6e5eb
msgid "VR teleoperation can command rapid motions. When using real hardware:"
msgstr "VR 遥操作可能发出快速运动指令。使用真实硬件时："

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:326
#: ce765dc2e19448eeb928f2bd9e46cf94
